+ signed-distance-line
    - p Point
    - v Point

SignedDistanceLine(p.x, vx == 0, vy >= 0, m, p.y - m * p.x, sqrt(m * m + 1))

.. vx = v.x - p.x
.. vy = v.y - p.y
.. m = vy / vx

